## Goal
Perform Principal Component Analysis (PCA) on gene-level counts to visualize how treated and untreated samples separate in reduced dimensionality space. This will reveal whether the treatment produces a clear transcriptional signature and help assess the strength of the biological effect across replicates.

## Inputs
Artifact types resolve through each sub-stage's OUTPUTS.tsv at execution time; the paths
below are what they resolve to today.

