## Execution
Runs: batch

Expected wall time: 2–3 minutes (data loading, filtering, transformation, PCA fitting, plot rendering).
Expected output size: ~50 KB (coordinates TSV ~1 KB, loadings TSV ~2 KB, interactive plot HTML ~20 KB).
Memory: < 1 GB for the 6-sample dataset.
